Package: qonlyreg
Title: Regression Analysis under Quantile and Summary Disclosure
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        "Masamune", "Iwasawa",
        email = "masamune.iwasawa@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Methods for regression analysis when only grouped summaries
    of the outcome distribution are available. The package implements
    estimation, partial identification, and inference procedures for
    linear regression models based on disclosed quantiles, reported
    means, and mixed disclosure. It also provides tools for sharp
    bounds, simultaneous confidence regions, and treatment-control
    contrast analysis for two-arm studies and meta-analysis applications.
